TronclassLoginDialog --> TodoItem
TronclassLoginDialog ..> LoginCallback

TrayManager --> MainFrame

ReminderService --> Task
ReminderService --> TodoItem
ReminderService --> Reminder
ReminderService ..> Notifier
ReminderService *-- ReminderNotification
ReminderNotification --> TargetType

SessionManager --> TronclassSessionStore
SessionManager --> State
SessionManager ..> SessionListener
TronclassSessionStore *-- SavedSession

TronclassService --> TodoItem
TronclassService --> CategoryManager
TronclassService *-- SessionExpiredException
