PdfScheduleImporter *-- PeriodMark
PdfScheduleImporter *-- Slot
PdfScheduleImporter *-- CourseInfo
PdfScheduleImporter *-- CourseKey

SchoolNewsCrawler --> NtouCseScraper
SchoolNewsCrawler --> NewsItem
NtouCseScraper --> NewsItem

XmlDataStore --> Task
XmlDataStore --> TodoItem
XmlDataStore --> Schedule
XmlDataStore --> Course
XmlDataStore --> Reminder

Task *-- Reminder
TodoItem *-- Reminder
Reminder --> ReminderType
Schedule *-- Course

ReminderEditorPanel --> Reminder
